    "exec": {
      "name": "exec",
      "description": "Execute JavaScript in code-mode. Pass raw JavaScript source.\n\nEvery other tool is available as an async function on the global `tools` object, e.g.\n`const r = await tools.read({ path: \"a.ts\" })`. Each call runs through the same permission,\nhook, and sandbox checks as a normal tool call. A tool returns a parsed object when its output\nis JSON, otherwise a string; a failing tool rejects (use try/catch).\n\nA tool with images returns {content, structuredContent}. Forward its media in order: for (const block of r.content) { if (block.type === 'text') text(block.text); else if (block.type === 'image') image(block); }. Saved paths remain model-visible text.\n\nGlobal helpers:\n- `text(value)`: append visible text output.\n- `image(value)`: append a data-URI or MCP image block output.\n- `store(key, value)` / `load(key)`: persist a JSON value across exec cells in this session.\n- `notify(value)`: surface a live status message while the program runs.\n- `yield_control()`: yield the current cell response and keep running in the background.\n- `exit()`: end the program successfully right now.\n- `setTimeout()` / `clearTimeout()`: schedule asynchronous JavaScript work.\n- `ALL_TOOLS`: array of `{ name, description }` for the available nested tools.\n\nEnvironment: plain JavaScript only; no Node, no require, no file system, no network, no console.",
      "inputKind": {
        "type": "freeform",
        "format": "javascript"
      },
      "inputSchema": null,
      "searchHint": null,
      "exposure": "direct",
      "maxResultSizeChars": null,
      "mcpServer": null,
      "isReadOnly": false,
      "isConcurrencySafe": false,
      "isDestructive": false,
      "summarize": "executing JavaScript in code-mode"
    },
    "wait": {
      "name": "wait",
      "description": "Wait for additional output from a live exec cell, or terminate it. Input uses `cell_id`, with optional `yield_time_ms`, `max_output_tokens`, and `terminate`.",
      "inputKind": {
        "type": "json_schema"
      },
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "cell_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The cell id returned by exec."
          },
          "yield_time_ms": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "How long to wait for new output before yielding again."
          },
          "max_output_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "Limit this observation's returned output without discarding the remainder."
          },
          "terminate": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "Terminate the live cell instead of waiting for more output."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "cell_id"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "searchHint": null,
      "exposure": "direct",
      "maxResultSizeChars": null,
      "mcpServer": null,
